The Kerneyy Prison Outpost is an infamous work camp used by the [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]] to hold dangerous individuals. The outpost is known for terribly harsh working conditions. It's also one of the most well-guarded locations in [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]], with zero successful escapes. Many of the prisoners held there are [[Org/Althane/Golden Sparrows|Golden Sparrows]]. The keep of [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/Umbervale Hold|Umbervale Hold]] stands on the same peninsula.
